    "title": "Macon-Bibb EOC accepts applications for Head Start and Early Head Start programs - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Addison White ,\n1 days ago MACON, Ga. (WGXA) — Macon-Bibb EOC opens free Head Start enrollment for families across Bibb and Monroe counties. The Macon-Bibb County Economic Opportunity Council, Inc. (EOC) says it is now accepting applications for its Head Start and Early Head Start programs, inviting families in Bibb and Monroe counties to enroll children from birth to age five for the upcoming program year. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
